====================================================================
DOMAIN: Conceptions of Freedom Hegel Rejects
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-04-15
PAPERS_FOUND: 11 total (High: 6, Medium: 4, Low: 1)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, CrossRef
